      lead: L("After a stretch of continuous screen time, a black bar grows out from under the notch. From there you can start a five-minute break countdown.", "连续看屏幕一段时间后，刘海下方会长出一块黑色提醒，可以从这里进入 5 分钟的休息倒计时。"),
